  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c2f466d8acd888e47941c8dd5566b0bc, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_ElderMoss
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Voidborne::DialogueTree
  startNodeId: root
  nodes:
  - nodeId: root
    speakerName: Elder Moss
    text: "Stranger... you carry the Maker's Mark. I have not seen its like since
      the Great Silence fell. You are welcome in Ashfen \u2014 but I have many questions."
    choices:
    - text: Who is 'the Maker'?
      nextNodeId: maker
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Tell me about Ashfen.
      nextNodeId: ashfen
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: I need to find a Stronghold.
      nextNodeId: stronghold_hint
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: "The device on my wrist \u2014 do you know what it is?"
      nextNodeId: cortex_react
      condition:
        type: 5
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Farewell.
      nextNodeId: 
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
  - nodeId: maker
    speakerName: Elder Moss
    text: "The Maker built the world before the VORD came. The old songs call them
      the Architect \u2014 a being of impossible knowledge who wove the land itself.
      We keep the faith because the faith kept us."
    choices:
    - text: What happened to the Architect?
      nextNodeId: maker_fate
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Back.
      nextNodeId: root
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
  - nodeId: maker_fate
    speakerName: Elder Moss
    text: "No one knows. The songs say the Maker sealed something terrible away \u2014
      and was sealed with it. Some of us believe the Strongholds are what remains.
      But the VORD guard them now."
    choices:
    - text: I'll find out the truth.
      nextNodeId: maker_hope
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Back.
      nextNodeId: root
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
  - nodeId: maker_hope
    speakerName: Elder Moss
    text: Then you carry more than the Mark, Stranger. You carry our hope. Go carefully.
    choices:
    - text: Tell me where Stronghold 1 is.
      nextNodeId: stronghold_hint
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 1
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Farewell.
      nextNodeId: 
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
  - nodeId: ashfen
    speakerName: Elder Moss
    text: "We survive in the fungal marshes because the VORD find the spores disruptive
      to their sensors. Small mercy. We trade with The Delve below when the tunnels
      are clear \u2014 and sometimes with Spire's Rest, if the sky is quiet."
    choices:
    - text: Back.
      nextNodeId: root
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
  - nodeId: stronghold_hint
    speakerName: Elder Moss
    text: "The nearest Stronghold stands in the old ruins to the east \u2014 we call
      it the Warden's Shell. VORD patrols circle it twice a day. Scout Wren knows
      the gap in their route."
    choices:
    - text: Thank you.
      nextNodeId: 
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
  - nodeId: cortex_react
    speakerName: Elder Moss
    text: "...\n\nThat is not just a device, Stranger. That is the Maker's hand.
      The songs describe it \u2014 the Wrist of the Architect, the instrument of
      Restoration. The elders thought it was myth.\n\nI need to sit down."
    choices:
    - text: I only just found it.
      nextNodeId: cortex_react2
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Farewell.
      nextNodeId: 
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
  - nodeId: cortex_react2
    speakerName: Elder Moss
    text: "Then the Architect's work is not finished. Find the Strongholds. Restore
      the device. Whatever the VORD truly are \u2014 you may be the only one who
      can stop them from finishing what they started."
    choices:
    - text: I will.
      nextNodeId: 
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
